# askru-site is a PUBLIC repository and it is served as-is.
#
# There was no .gitignore here at all until 17 Nov 2026. Nothing dangerous had been
# committed — checked before writing this: `assets/config.js` carries one token and it
# decodes to role `anon` on the Ask Ru project, which is what it is for, and the only
# three mentions of `service_role` in this repo are the comment telling you never to
# put that key here. So this is a guard, not a clean-up.
#
# WHAT THIS CAN AND CANNOT DO — read before trusting it:
#
#   · It does NOT protect a file that is already tracked. `git rm --cached` is the
#     only thing that stops a tracked file being published.
#   · It does NOT survive `git add -f`, which is exactly how an ignored file ends up
#     committed by somebody in a hurry.
#   · It is itself PUBLIC and served. Every line here is readable at the site's own
#     domain, so this file names only generic patterns on purpose. A list of this
#     project's interesting filenames would be a map, and a map of what we hide is
#     worth more to somebody looking than the patterns are worth to us.
#
# The real protection is that no secret belongs in this repo in any form. The site
# talks to Supabase with the anon key and RLS; everything privileged goes through an
# edge function.

# ── environment and secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
*.asc

# ── credentials a tool might drop here ────────────────────────────────────────
.netrc
.npmrc
.supabase/
.vercel/
.wrangler/
.firebase/
service-account*.json
gha-creds-*.json

# ── editor and OS litter ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── the shapes a backup takes, which is how a draft gets published ────────────
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp
*.old
*.save
*.copy
*copy.html
*-backup.*
*.html.bak

# ── build and dependency output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ── archives, which hide everything above inside themselves ───────────────────
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
